                <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true"><!---->Consult with your partner before making any big budgeting decisions, and make sure you’re both on the same page.</span></p><!---->
